  "Question": "What are the two properties of similar polygons? Select the correct option.",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "Corresponding angles are equal, and corresponding sides are equal.",
    "B": "Corresponding angles are equal, and corresponding sides are proportional.",
    "C": "Corresponding sides are proportional, and the perimeters are equal.",
    "D": "Corresponding angles are supplementary, and corresponding sides are proportional."
